# The model bundle is over Hugging Face's 10 MB plain-file limit, and only the
# Space needs it, so it stays in LFS.
*.pt filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# NOTE: the hero video is deliberately NOT LFS-tracked. Vercel does not fetch
# LFS objects, so an LFS-tracked video is served to visitors as a ~130 byte
# pointer file and never plays. Hugging Face rejects plain .mp4 on push, which
# is why the Space is deployed with tools/push_space.py - it pushes only the
# backend and model, and never sees this file.
